Z||000022||CoolBlue87GT||09-15-2001||09:00 PM||||         <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Master_Sushi:<BR><B>Even plain blue 87s are somewhat rare.           <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Plain blue ? Mine's not plain. It has metalflake in the paint. The 87's blue is metallic and clearcoat over that.<P>Did this 85 look like this ?<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00121.jpg">        <BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00120.jpg">        <BR>        <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Dsc00119.jpg">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 09-16-2001).]||||reg||1
